@host = https://localhost:7186

### Create a sample (command with a response) — returns 200 + a message
POST {{host}}/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test": "hello"
}

### Create a sample with an invalid body — returns 400 ProblemDetails (validation behaviour)
POST {{host}}/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test": ""
}

### Update a sample (command with no response) — returns 200
PUT {{host}}/samples
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "test": "hello"
}
